  "introduction": "Consolidate primary mathematics and prepare for secondary study through direct and inverse proportion.",
  "definition": "In direct proportion, the ratio y/x remains constant for nonzero x. In inverse proportion, the product xy remains constant for nonzero x. Use inverse proportion only when the situation justifies a fixed total of work or quantity.",
